# Discrete-time experiments: model weights, prepared datasets and farm logs.
# All regenerable from the scripts, seeds and metadata here (see
# Raissi_disc_time_approach/_shared/README.md).
#
# `**` rather than `*`: the experiments were grouped into block folders on
# 2026-09-08, so they now sit at Raissi_disc_time_approach/<Block>/<Experiment>/
# rather than one level down. A single `*` stopped matching and would have
# committed 1.23 GB of weights, datasets and farm logs.
Raissi_disc_time_approach/**/results/*.pt
Raissi_disc_time_approach/**/results/*.npz
Raissi_disc_time_approach/**/condor/logs/
